  "summary": {
    "value": "A small LoRA that teaches a normal 35B text LLM to take part in a live voice call where both sides can talk at the same time. There is no voice activity detector in the loop: every 0.6 seconds the model reads the few words the microphone just heard and either writes a few words to say next or writes .",
